# The same kernel with a left window of 768: the key loop's lower bound
# adds a branch, and the block past the branch at line 367 runs when
# `%r68 = ⌊%r69/64⌋`, the same for the whole CTA, the two bounds'
# blocks. The trip counts stay unknown for the same reasons, the inner
# key loop's still depending on the CTA index through the tile loop.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/gluon/attn_fwd_ws_kernel.w768.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry attn_fwd_ws_kernel( // block 256×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | shared memory 0 B/CTA + dynamic | per CTA: flops f32 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); tensor flops bf16 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); sfu flops f32 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); global load ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39), store ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39); shared load ? B (trips of $L__BB0_2), store ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39); param load 18,432 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	setp.eq.b32 	%p96, %r1845, 0; // [<block 1>] warp 0-3 × lane * | exec 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	add.s64 	%rd149, %rd25, %rd142; // [<block 2>] warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when %ctaid.x < param_10 (CTA-uniform, branch at line 258) | exec <= 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__tmp5: // warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when %r68@275 = ⌊%r69@277/64⌋ (CTA-uniform, branch at line 367) | nested in line 261 | exec <= 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_39:                             // =>This Loop Header: Depth=1 // loop: trips ? (loop exit is not at the latch) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 261 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	waitLoop: // loop: trips ? (latch predicate is defined by `mbarrier.test_wait.parity.shared::cta.b64`, not a comparison) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 261 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_43:                             //   Parent Loop BB0_39 Depth=1 // loop: trips ? (uniform(%r1979@$L__BB0_43) is defined in an enclosing loop: depends on %r1979, carried around an enclosing loop) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 663 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_2:                              // %.preheader515 // loop: trips ? (loop has multiple latches) | warp 4-7 × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
